WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.096
Step 1. View the appointments on the profile. Select the Appointments tab.

1.2
00:00:05.096 --> 00:00:09.133
It lists the patient's appointments at every facility.

2.1
00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:12.451
Step 2. View today's appointment on Patient Home.

2.2
00:00:12.451 --> 00:00:17.147
The Upcoming Appointment card shows the patient's appointment today at this

2.3
00:00:17.147 --> 00:00:18.211
facility.

3.1
00:00:18.211 --> 00:00:21.678
Step 3. View the appointments at this facility.

3.2
00:00:21.678 --> 00:00:27.518
On Patient Home, the Appointments tab lists only this facility's appointments.

4.1
00:00:27.518 --> 00:00:32.919
Step 4. View the tokens. On a large screen, they show in a side panel.

4.2
00:00:32.919 --> 00:00:35.921
Select a token to see its details.
